      <slug></slug>
      <title>Welcome</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Ada Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the Ada Developer Room at FOSDEM 2012, which is organized by Ada-Belgium in cooperation with Ada-Europe.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ada-Belgium and Ada-Europe are both non-profit organizations set to promote the use of Ada, and to disseminate the knowledge of it into academic, research and industrial establishments in Belgium and Europe, resp. Ada-Europe has member-organizations, such as Ada-Belgium, in various countries.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;More information on this event is available on the Ada-Belgium web-site (see link).&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="4141">Dirk Craeynest</person>
      </persons>
